  [38;5;246mThe app logs task edits and shows a digest on return, and picks up edits made in other tabs of the same browser.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m [ ] Any edit to a watched task
  [38;5;246mEvery create/edit/complete on a watched task fires a notification immediately, including your own. Simple and literal,
[39m  [38;5;246mbut noisy in a solo app.[39m
